---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/03-10/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/03-10/interactions.json';
const a='/equipment/03-10/',drawing='https://www.dentsply.com/content/dam/dentsply/pim/manufacturer/Prosthetics/Laboratory_Supplies/Investing__Burnout/Equipment/Burnout_Furnaces_power_door/Burnout-Furnaces-power-door-zirp8k9-manual-pdf-en-1402#page=14',catalog='https://sa.usdentaldepot.com/downloads_dir/webUSA/2011_Ney_Catalog.pdf', photo='https://i.ebayimg.com/images/g/NpUAAeSwW6JpAPJU/s-l960.jpg';
const display=x=>Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Ney Vulcan 3-1750 dry shelf geometry" subtitle="" description="Inspect a non-operational Vulcan 3-1750 silhouette and check an inert empty tray's rectangular clearances." wide={true}>
<article id="cold" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/03-10/">← Equipment 03-10</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#cold-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">03-10 / Ney Vulcan 3-1750 / Cold geometry</p><h2>Ney Vulcan 3-1750</h2><p>Inspect the cabinet and check a centered, empty tray against an original dry shelf. The 250 × 180 × 45 mm example leaves 30 mm at each width side, 45 mm at each depth side and 150 mm of headroom. Nothing heats up.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the display model</h3><div id="cold-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Shelf','Rear'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="cold-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div>
<canvas id="cold-model" aria-label="Orbitable metric cabinet with a cold cavity, shelf and inert empty tray"></canvas><p id="cold-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Click the door depiction to expose the cold geometry, or the shelf to check the fit. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom. The control panel is decorative.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Gauge the empty tray</h3><div class="e-row"><button id="cold-view" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Show cold cavity</button><button id="cold-example" class="e-run" type="button">Show and check example</button></div>
<form id="cold-form" novalidate><div class="e-fields"><label>Empty tray ID<input name="dummyId" value="empty-dry-tray-01" maxlength="96"/></label>{[['widthMm','Width X (mm)',250,480],['depthMm','Depth Z (mm)',180,480],['heightMm','Height Y (mm)',45,300]].map(([k,t,v,max])=><label>{t}<input name={k} type="number" min="1" max={max} step="any" value={v}/></label>)}</div>
<div class="e-row"><button id="cold-check" class="e-run" type="submit">Check shelf clearance</button><button id="cold-rotate" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Toggle quarter turn</button><button id="cold-oversize" type="button">Set wider tray</button><button id="cold-reset" type="button">Reset</button></div></form><p id="cold-status" role="status">Exterior view, non-operational.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read the fit</h3><p id="cold-result" role="status">No shelf clearance evaluated.</p><div class="e-row"><button id="cold-json" disabled>Dry fit JSON</button></div><p>With a centered rectangle, each horizontal allowance is half the unused width or depth. Headroom is one-sided above the original shelf plane. Turning the tray 90° swaps its footprint dimensions. The model does not check trajectories, tolerances, deformation or actual loading suitability. <a href={a+'example-fit.json'}>Example geometry result</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Reference geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original metric exterior model of the 3-1750"/><figcaption>Original model using the manufacturer’s 1750 outline and <a href={catalog}>Ney’s product catalogue, p. 14</a>.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original cold opening and empty dry shelf visualization"/><figcaption>The vertical-lift door is shown as a visual pose, not an actuation model. <a href={photo}>Documentary photograph of the open front</a> illustrates the pale lining and panel beneath it.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Geometry</th><th>Nominal value</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Closed housing width × depth × height</td><td>610 × 535 × 545 mm</td><td><a href={drawing}>Dentsply 1750 mechanical outline, p. 14</a>, C × D × B; A = 815 mm open envelope.</td></tr><tr><td>Internal cavity width × depth × height</td><td>360 × 320 × 250 mm</td><td>Same drawing, F × G × E.</td></tr><tr><td>Original shelf projection and clear height</td><td>310 × 270 × 195 mm</td><td>Design assumptions for this tray demonstration only. Linkage positions and rails are illustrative.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The register’s temperature-history acceptance is outside this geometry-only pass. No controller, program, timeline, heating, treatment or material response is implemented.</p></section>
<section id="cold-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'vulcan-3-1750.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/03-10/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#cold header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#cold h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#cold section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#cold button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#cold button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#cold-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#cold-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#cold table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#cold td,#cold th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#cold figure{margin:0}#cold img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#cold caption{text-align:left}#cold input,#cold select,#cold button{min-width:0}#cold .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}</style>
